(418, 1, 'General', NULL, 'Kandhula Manoj Kumar', 'kandhulamanojkumar663@gmail.com', '9491779518', 'or schema alignment).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Knowledge\\n- **View Leave Details Modal Alert Replacement**:\\n  - *\\\"view se leave dekh rhe h to alert a rha hai sweet alert hi lga do isme bhi\\\"* -> Replace standard native `confirm()` in `admin/leave/index.blade.php` modal JS with `confirmSwalAction`.\\n- **Announcement Target Audience Removal**:\\n  - *\\\"target audiance ko hta do\\\"* -> Remove `Target Audience` dropdowns from Notice creation/editing forms and default all notices to `All Employees`.\\n- **Default Work Location**:\\n  - *\\\"work location mai defalut mai remote likh do\\\"* -> Default `Work Location` input field value to `Remote` in employee create and edit forms.\\n- **Candidate ATS Form Simplification**:\\n  - *\\\"Hiring Company (Client) * Pipeline Stage / Status * ye dono option hta dena\\\"* -> Remove `Hiring Company (Client)` and `Pipeline Stage / Status` fields from Candidate registration and edit forms. Default `company_name` to `\'General\'` and `status` to `\'Applied\'`.\\n- **Live PDF Resume Editor**:\\n  - *\\\"can we edit pdf edittor also so that resume edits in our system and save as copy resume\\\"* -> Add an interactive Live Resume PDF Editor modal on candidate profile (`/admin/candidates/{id}`) with real-time A4 canvas preview', 'data analysis', 0, 'Remote', 'Immediate', 360000, NULL, 'Applied', 'and `quick_create.blade.php`.\\n- **Implemented Interactive Live PDF Resume Editor**:\\n  - Added **`✨ Open Live PDF Resume Editor`** button on Candidate Profile (`resources/views/admin/candidates/show.blade.php`).\\n  - Added modal editor with side-by-side controls (Candidate Details', 'Anonymization toggle', '`edit.blade.php`', NULL, 0, '2026-08-19 17:58:48', '2026-08-19 17:58:48');
